WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
We spent the day getting Apex Wellness ready, and scraping off the old window lettering was a bigger job than we expected.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Between figuring out a fridge pickup, sorting out our centrifuge order, and running back and forth to FedEx, there was plenty to keep us busy.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
But the best part was meeting local business owners and learning about the neighborhood.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
We also discovered some seriously good donuts.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
We got our posters and our QR codes up, and the place is starting to look like Apex.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
There’s still work ahead, but we’re excited to bring you along.
